Package: goto
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, coreutils
Recommends: bash-completion
Description: lightweight directory shortcut manager for POSIX shells
 goto is a directory bookmark manager that lets you register named
 shortcuts to directories and jump to them with tab completion.
 .
 Features include subpath navigation, shortcut cleanup, import/export,
 and shell integration for Bash, Zsh, and Fish.
